lor scheme. The background has been changed to a more neutral setting, and the overall layout is more compact and intimate.', 'The living room now features a wooden table and chairs in the center, replacing the couches. The windows have been updated with blinds, and the wall color has been changed to grey. The shot is taken from a straight angle, providing a clear view of the entire room.', 'The final image shows a metal water bottle with a gray ombre design, placed against a white background. The lid of the bottle has been changed to gray.', 'The final image shows a clear plastic water bottle with a smaller teal bottle upside down inside it, both with a lid, and the entire bottle has been changed to a blue color.', 'The final image shows a teal metal water bottle and a blue water bottle with a silver lid, maintaining the same shape and size as the original.', 'The image now features a darker blue bottle, which appears to be made of plastic, with a straw attached to it. The lid of the bottle has been changed to white.', 'The final image shows a blue plastic water bottle with a white cap, featuring an imprinted character on its surface. The bottle is closed, and the background is not visible, focusing solely on the bottle.', 'The final image shows a reusable water bottle with a purple-toned appearance, featuring a closed lid and no straw. The bottle is made of aluminum, and the field of view is narrower, focusing closely on the bottle.', "The final image shows a spacious living room with three sofas and two chairs arranged around a larger, rectangular dining table. The room has a wider field of view, revealing more of the living area, and the background has been changed to a beach setting with sand and ocean waves visible through the windows. The dining table is now a more substantial, rectangular piece of furniture, and the room's overall layout has been expanded to include the additional seating and table.", 'The living room now features a visible white-framed ceil