w from above. The background has been replaced with the bottom of a hamster cage, and the leg has been removed from the scene.', 'The image now shows three bottles placed on top of a red strip, viewed straight on from a farther back perspective, with the background changed to a solid white.']Gnerating descriptions:  35%|███▍      | 45/130 [08:48<17:19, 12.23s/it]Gnerating descriptions:  35%|███▌      | 46/130 [08:57<15:57, 11.40s/it]
